**DEFECT 1: `TestSnapshotCases.java` (new file) - Lines 16-19**

```java
// Index created in vES_5 - Basic mapping
public static final String ES_VERSION_6 = "5";

// Index created in vES_5 - Custom-Analyzer - standard token filter
public static final String ES_VERSION_6_STANDARD_TOKEN_FILTER = "5_custom_analyzer";
```

**Failure scenario:** All version 6 compatibility tests (`RestoreFromVersion6IT`, `RestoreFromVersion6CustomAnalyzerIT`, `MountFromVersion6IT`, `MountFromVersion6CustomAnalyzerIT`) will incorrectly load version 5 snapshots (`snapshot_v5.zip` and `snapshot_v5_custom_analyzer.zip`) instead of the intended version 6 snapshots (`snapshot_v6.zip` and `snapshot_v6_custom_analyzer.zip`). This gives false confidence about v6 snapshot compatibility — the tests pass but don't exercise the actual v6 upgrade path.

The constants should be:
- `ES_VERSION_6 = "6"`
- `ES_VERSION_6_STANDARD_TOKEN_FILTER = "6_custom_analyzer"`

(Also the comments incorrectly say "vES_5" for both v6 constants.)
